<div class="center_fun">
    <h1>Sugar Blossom</h1>
    <br />
    <h2>Who are we?</h2>
    <br />
    <img src="~/img/homeimg.jpg" class="image"/>
    <br />
    <br />
    <p class="left-text">
        This is how the story starts, in a small town filled with laughter and sunshine, a family gathered around their kitchen table every Sunday to bake together. 
        Flour dusted the air, children giggled as they sneaked tastes of frosting, and friends from the neighborhood often stopped by just to share in the joy.
        From those moments of warmth and togetherness, Sugar Blossom was born. 
        More than a bakery, it became a place where happiness rises with every loaf, and friendship is sprinkled into every cupcake. 
        The name “Sugar Blossom” reflects the idea that sweetness blooms when shared — whether it’s a birthday cake, a box of cookies for a friend, or a 
        quiet moment with a warm pastry and coffee.
        <br /> <br />
        At Sugar Blossom, every recipe carries a story:
        <ul class="left-text">
            <li><strong>Family traditions</strong> passed down through generations.</li>
            <li><strong>Friendship</strong> celebrated with shared treats.</li>
            <li><strong>Joy</strong> baked into every detail, from the swirl of buttercream to the delicate cherry blossom on top.</li>
        </ul>
    </p>
    <p class="left-text">
        The bakery quickly became a gathering spot — where neighbors meet, families celebrate milestones,
        and strangers leave as friends. It's not just about pastries; it's about creating memories, one bite at a time.
        <br />
    </p>
    <i> The essence of Sugar Blossom is simple: sweetness tastes better when shared.</i>
</div>
